{"id":96,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"大学連携の教育研究と自己決定を重視する附属中","feature_description":"千葉大学教育学部附属中学校は、中等普通教育に加え、大学と連携した教育の実験研究と教育学部生の教育実習を担います。教育目標では、自己理解をもとに自ら行動を決め、選択を実現する主体的な人間の形成を重視。広い視野で明るく活動する生徒を育てるとし、粘り強く課題に取り組むこと、思考・判断・表現、他者との協働も生徒像に示しています。","clubs":[{"id":1619,"name":"野球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/bukatsudo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1620,"name":"陸上競技","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/bukatsudo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1622,"name":"サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/bukatsudo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1623,"name":"卓球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/bukatsudo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1625,"name":"男子ソフトテニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/bukatsudo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1626,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/bukatsudo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1628,"name":"女子ソフトテニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/bukatsudo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1629,"name":"吹奏楽","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/bukatsudo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1631,"name":"科学","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/bukatsudo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1633,"name":"男子バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/bukatsudo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1634,"name":"女子バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/bukatsudo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14580,"name":"女子バレーボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/bukatsudo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14581,"name":"文芸（仮称）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/bukatsudo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"}],"profile_sources":[{"id":2524,"att